flowchart TB
    Job[examples/job.py: FedAvgRecipe]
    Server[NVFLARE server]
    Job -->|Execute or export| Server
    subgraph Owner[Data owner: on premises or approved cloud]
        Receive[client.py: flare.receive]
        Runner[wes.py: WesRunner.run]
        State[(Durable site run.json)]
        WES[Existing GA4GH WES service]
        Workflow[site-workflow.cwl calls analysis.py]
        Output[WesRunner.read_json_output]
        Validate[client.py: validate shape and values]
        Send[client.py: flare.send]
        Local[Local mode: analysis.calculate]
        Receive -->|WES mode| Runner
        Runner <-->|Persist run ID and context| State
        Runner <-->|WES HTTP requests| WES
        WES -->|Site workflow execution| Workflow
        WES -->|Declared result location| Output
        Workflow -->|JSON output in approved storage| Output
        Output --> Validate
        Receive -->|Local mode| Local
        Local --> Validate
        Validate --> Send
    end
    Server -->|Federation task| Receive
    Send -->|Validated site result| Server
